1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,500
This is Mango. And this… is dinner.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:07,900
Here’s how to serve it, in three easy steps.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,800
Step one. Weigh your dog.

4
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:16,300
Thirty kilos? Around 350 grams a day.

5
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,350
Step two. Measure it out.

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,100
One cup holds about 100 grams.

7
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,500
Step three. Serve it your way.

8
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,450
Dry, straight from the pack.

9
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,950
Sprinkle on warm water, for extra flavour and aroma.

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,900
Or mash it.

11
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:39,950
Pro tip: it’s more nutrient-dense than kibble, so you’ll feed less.

12
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:45,200
Right4Paws Ultimate Diet. Raw, made right.
